<HelloFraandsPage updated="2026-10-23" title="Refund & cancellation" summary="Jo call ho chuki, uske paise wapas nahi hote. Jo paisa wapas banta hai, woh hamesha aapke wallet mein aata hai." review={true} related={[{"href":"/wallet-terms","label":"Wallet terms"},{"href":"/terms","label":"Terms of use"},{"href":"/grievance","label":"Grievance redressal"}]}>
<h2>Calls that were made are not refunded</h2>
<p>{BRAND.name} does not refund calls that were made. You choose the influencer, you see the rate before you call, and you can hang up at any second. You only pay for the minutes you spoke. The one exception is the first-minute rule below.</p>
<h2>We are not responsible for how a call went</h2>
<p>{BRAND.name} connects you with an independent influencer. We are not responsible for your experience with a particular influencer, so we cannot refund a call because the conversation was not what you hoped for. Rate the influencer, try someone else, and <a href="/report">report the influencer</a> if they broke a rule.</p>
<h2>When you pay nothing</h2>
<p>A call is made once we have rung both of you and joined the call. Until then, nothing is charged. If the influencer declines, cancels or does not answer, you pay nothing. A call that fails before we join you also costs nothing.</p>
<h2>If a joined call breaks in the first minute</h2>
<p>If a call breaks within the first minute after we joined you, we charge ₹1 and return the rest to your wallet.</p>
<h2>Booked calls</h2>
<p>A booked call holds the cost of the first 15 minutes (or of the whole call if it is 15 minutes) in your wallet. You can cancel free until 1 hour before the booked time, and the whole hold comes back to your wallet. After that, the hold is kept. If the influencer does not pick up at the booked time, the full hold comes back to your wallet. If the influencer cancels, it always comes back. If an influencer approves bookings and declines your request, does not accept it in time, or you withdraw it, the full amount comes back too. If you do talk, you pay only for the minutes you spoke and the rest of the hold comes back.</p>
<h2>All call refunds go to your wallet</h2>
<p>Every refund for a call or a booking goes back to your wallet. We never send a call refund to your card or UPI.</p>
<h2>T-shirts from influencers</h2>
<p>Each T-shirt is printed for you, so we do not take returns or exchanges. If the item arrives wrong or damaged, report it within 48 hours of delivery with a photo, and we will replace it or refund you. If we cannot make your order, you get a full refund. A T-shirt refund goes back the way you paid: to your wallet if you paid from your wallet, and to your payment method if you paid online. You tick this refund policy before you pay for a T-shirt.</p>
<h2>Taking your wallet money out</h2>
<p>Anyone can withdraw wallet money with the Withdraw button. We send it only to your own UPI ID after a one-time ID (KYC) check, in whole rupees with no fee. Test credits can be spent on calls but cannot be withdrawn. An influencer's earnings are held for 7 days before they can be withdrawn.</p>
<h2>Billing errors are corrected</h2>
<p>If you are charged twice for the same call, or charged for a call that was never made, that is a billing error, not a refund request. Report it with the call ID, date and time. It will be checked against the call details and the wrong amount put back in your wallet, linked to that call.</p>
<h2>Information for a billing query</h2>
<p>Provide the call ID, date and time, amount, transaction reference and a short explanation, and keep your receipt. Never send an OTP, UPI PIN, Aadhaar number or full card details. We will never ask for them. See the <a href="/grievance">grievance page</a> for how to raise a complaint, and the <a href="/help">help centre</a> for simple guides on the <a href="/help/wallet-and-payments/no-refunds">refund rules</a> and <a href="/help/wallet-and-payments/billing-errors">billing mistakes</a>.</p>
</HelloFraandsPage>
